<title>USA: Coventry Corp names new president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Coventry Corp names new president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Corp said Monday that Allen Wise has been appointed president and chief executive of the managed health care company.</p>
<p>Wise replaces Lawrence Kugelman, who has been serving as the company's interim president and chief executive since December 1995.</p>
<p>Wise is expected to assume the new position on October 7, the company said.  Kugelman will remain a director of the company.  </p>
<p>Most recently, Wise was the executive vice president for United HealthCare Corp.</p>
</text>
